  "solution": "Check with options one by one:\n\nGiven expression: 5 × 132 ÷ 11 - 28 + 70 = 18\n\n1) - and ×\n\n5 - 132 ÷ 11 × 28 + 70\n\n= 5 - 12 × 28 + 70\n\n= 5 - 336 + 70\n\n= - 261 ≠ 18\n\n2) ÷ and ×\n\n5 ÷ 132 × 11 - 28 + 70\n\n= 0.037 × 11 - 28 + 70\n\n= 0.407 - 28 + 70\n\n= 42.407 ≠ 18\n\n3) + and -\n\n5 × 132 ÷ 11 + 28 - 70\n\n= 5 × 12 + 28 - 70\n\n= 60 + 28 - 70\n\n= 18\n\n4) + and ×\n\n5 + 132 ÷ 11 - 28 × 70\n\n= 5 + 12 - 28 × 70\n\n= 5 + 12 - 1960\n\n= -1943 ≠ 18\n\nHence, **\"+ and -\"** is the correct answer.",
